rsion\n2:59:31 Integer & Float, Types, Math\n3:11:33 Rounding, Random, Validation\n3:28:04 Boolean Values\n3:42:33 Comparison & Logical Operators\n4:06:13 Membership & Identity Operators\n4:19:19 If, Else, Elif\n4:40:34 Nested & Advanced Conditions\n4:57:33 Inline If & Match Case\n5:24:56 For Loops\n5:47:57 Break, Continue, Pass\n6:18:39 For-Else & Nested Loops\n6:40:52 While Loops\n7:10:04 Lists Overview\n7:19:40 Creating & Accessing Lists\n7:48:08 Unpacking & Analyzing\n8:19:18 Add, Remove & Update\n8:41:46 Sorting & Combining\n9:18:29 Iterables & Filtering\n9:41:38 Lambda & List Comprehension\n10:12:01 Tuples\n10:19:59 Sets\n10:38:12 Dictionaries\n11:09:45 Functions Introduction\n11:28:12 Function Parameters & Return\n12:20:31 Types of Python Functions\n12:46:09 Writing Clean Functions\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n*CONNECT WITH ME*\n💬 Discord https://discord.gg/gsVJbMxKcA\n👨‍💻 LinkedIn https://www.linkedin.com/in/baraa-khatib-salkini/\n📸 Instagram https://www.instagram.com/datawithbaraa/\n🎥 TikTok https://www.tiktok.com/@datawithbaraa\n🧭 Notion Roadmaps https://www.notion.com/@datawithbaraa\n\nNote: some links above are affiliates. I may earn a small commission\nif you enroll. Thank you for supporting the channel.\n\n#python #learnpython #ai #dataanalytics #datascience #coding",
